.SH DESCRIPTION
Write a known pattern to LBA 0 through the \fB--be\fP backend, read it back
through the \fB--alt-be\fP backend, and verify the data matches.
Both backends share the same NVMe controller on the same device URI.
NOTE: overwrites LBA 0; only use on a device where that is safe.
